# MAPS 13 Nov 2026: the COBRA LAB OUTPOST (Gen-Tek Research Park), live and crewed. 100 x 100 x 5 from 100 fixed 10x10 blocks.
# Base blocks use `terrain:`; the 36 RING blocks have no terrain key, so they come from the MISSION's terrain (biome ring: John 14:51).
# LB1RING is the desert ring for now; every biome ring set uses the same part names and order (see the ring brief).
# .MAP2 version (BUILD 13 Nov 15:35): every base block uses the one terrain LB1BASE (916 parts, under the 1,000 budget);
# ring blocks have no terrain key (= the mission terrain). Needs game build 0193a43 or later.
terrains:
  - name: LB1BASE
    mapDataSets:
      - BLANKS
      - OUTBASE
      - LABSCI
      - OUTYARD
      - LABTEST
      - LABSITE
      - LABAIR
      - OUTHALL
      - BIGLAB
      - FURN
      - INTER
      - LIFE
